  "raw": "{\"teaching_intent\":\"让学生在月面弱重力中操控抛出方式、初速、角度、高度、重力与质量，观察同一物理时间内轨迹、速度/加速度方向与动能/势能变化的因果；比较平抛与斜抛的飞行时间、射程、最高点，并理解质量不改变轨迹但改变能量标度。通过暂停、慢放、拖动与回放区分真实物理时间和演示倍率，而不是自动给出解题步骤。\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>月面平抛与斜抛运动模型</title><style>:root{--bg:#0b1020;--card:#151d34;--ink:#eef4ff;--muted:#9fb0d0;--acc:#62d0ff;--warn:#ffd166;--ok:#7cf2b0}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%,#1a2747 0,#0b1020 55%);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",sans-serif}main{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px}.card{background:rgba(21,29,52,.92);border:1px solid #2b3a63;border-radius:16px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #0007}h1{font-size:22px;margin:6px 0 2px}.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .85fr;gap:12px}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:19px}}svg{width:100%;height:auto;min-height:300px;background:#08101f;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #28365e}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}@media(max-width:480px){.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}}label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:5px}input,select,button{width:100%;min-height:44px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid #33477c;background:#0e1830;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;padding:8px 10px}input[type=range]{padding:0}button{cursor:pointer;background:#1c2c55;font-weight:700}button.primary{background:#176d9d}.row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.row>*{flex:1}.pill{border:1px solid #33477c;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 10px;background:#0d1730;font-size:13px}.vals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;font-size:13px}.val{background:#0d1730;border:1px solid #293d6d;border-radius:10px;padding:8px}.val b{color:var(--acc)}.bar{height:12px;background:#0a1328;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #2b3c68}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#62d0ff,#7cf2b0);width:0}.bar.p>i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffd166,#ff8b6a)}.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}.legend{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px}</style></head><body><!--HARNESS_PRIMITIVES--><!--HARNESS_MODEL--><!--HARNESS_INPUT--><main><section class=\\\"card\\\"><h1>月面平抛与斜抛运动模型</h1><div class=\\\"sub\\\">已确认场景：月面 5 m 高处、4 m/s 水平抛出、0.2 kg、g=1.62 m/s²。拖到任意时刻，比较弱重力下“走得慢、落得久、能量此消彼长”。</div></section><div class=\\\"grid\\\"><section class=\\\"card\\\"><svg id=\\\"stage\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 640 360\\\" aria-label=\\\"运动轨迹\\\"><defs><marker id=\\\"ah\\\" markerWidth=\\\"8\\\" markerHeight=\\\"8\\\" refX=\\\"7\\\" refY=\\\"4\\\" orient=\\\"auto\\\"><path d=\\\"M0 0L8 4L0 8z\\\" fill=\\\"#62d0ff\\\"></path></marker><marker id=\\\"ah2\\\" markerWidth=\\\"8\\\" markerHeight=\\\"8\\\" refX=\\\"7\\\" refY=\\\"4\\\" orient=\\\"auto\\\"><path d=\\\"M0 0L8 4L0 8z\\\" fill=\\\"#ffd166\\\"></path></marker></defs><rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"330\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"30\\\" fill=\\\"#26304d\\\"></rect><line x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"330\\\" x2=\\\"640\\\" y2=\\\"330\\\" stroke=\\\"#9fb0d0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"></line><path id=\\\"traj\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#7cf2b0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"7 5\\\"></path><line id=\\\"vx\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"0\\\" y2=\\\"0\\\" stroke=\\\"#62d0ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" marker-end=\\\"url(#ah)\\\"></line><line id=\\\"ax\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"0\\\" y2=\\\"0\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffd166\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" marker-end=\\\"url(#ah2)\\\"></line><circle id=\\\"ball\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" fill=\\\"#ff6b8b\\\" stroke=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"></circle><circle id=\\\"start\\\" r=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"#eef4ff\\\"></circle><circle id=\\\"land\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#ffd166\\\"></circle><text id=\\\"cap\\\" x=\\\"14\\\" y=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"#eef4ff\\\" font-size=\\\"14\\\">暂停：按“播放”观察物理时间流逝</text></svg><div class=\\\"legend\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\" style=\\\"background:#62d0ff\\\"></span>速度方向 <span class=\\\"dot\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffd166\\\"></span>加速度方向 <span class=\\\"dot\\\" style=\\\"background:#7cf2b0\\\"></span>采样轨迹</div></section><aside class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"row\\\"><button class=\\\"primary\\\" id=\\\"play\\\">播放</button><button id=\\\"pause\\\">暂停</button><button data-replay id=\\\"replay\\\">回放</button></div><div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><span class=\\\"pill\\\">物理时间 <b data-physical-time id=\\\"pt\\\">--</b></span><span class=\\\"pill\\\">演示倍率 <b data-demo-time id=\\\"dr\\\">--</b></span></div><label style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">演示倍率（只改显示快慢，不改物理）</label><input id=\\\"rate\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0.1\\\" max=\\\"4\\\" step=\\\"0.1\\\" value=\\\"1\\\"><div class=\\\"controls\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><div><label>抛出方式</label><select id=\\\"mode\\\" data-control><option value=\\\"horizontal\\\">平抛 horizontal</option><option value=\\\"oblique\\\">斜抛 oblique</option></select></div><div><label>初速度 <span id=\\\"spv\\\">4.0</span> m/s</label><input id=\\\"speed\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" max=\\\"12\\\" step=\\\"0.1\\\" value=\\\"4\\\"></div><div><label>角度 <span id=\\\"anv\\\">0</span>°（平抛固定为0）</label><input id=\\\"ang\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"80\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"0\\\"></div><div><label>初始高度 <span id=\\\"hv\\\">5.0</span> m</label><input id=\\\"h\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0.5\\\" max=\\\"20\\\" step=\\\"0.1\\\" value=\\\"5\\\"></div><div><label>重力加速度 <span id=\\\"gv\\\">1.62</span> m/s²</label><input id=\\\"g\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0.5\\\" max=\\\"9.8\\\" step=\\\"0.01\\\" value=\\\"1.62\\\"></div><div><label>质量 <span id=\\\"mv\\\">0.20</span> kg（影响能量，不影响轨迹形状）</label><input id=\\\"m\\\" data-control type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0.05\\\" max=\\\"2\\\" step=\\\"0.05\\\" value=\\\"0.2\\\"></div></div></aside></div><section class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"vals\\\"><div class=\\\"val\\\">状态读数 <b data-readout id=\\\"ro\\\">等待采样</b></div><div class=\\\"val\\\">事件：飞行 <b id=\\\"evf\\\">--</b>，射程 <b id=\\\"evr\\\">--</b>，最高点 <b id=\\\"evh\\\">--</b></div><div class=\\\"val\\\">动能 <b id=\\\"ek\\\">--</b><div class=\\\"bar\\\"><i id=\\\"ekb\\\"></i></div></div><div class=\\\"val\\\">势能 <b id=\\\"ep\\\">--</b><div class=\\\"bar p\\\"><i id=\\\"epb\\\"></i></div></div></div><p class=\\\"hint\\\">观察任务：1) 保持其它量不变，把 g 从 1.62 调大，比较飞行时间与下落加速度箭头；2) 平抛改斜抛后拖动时间轴，找 vy=0 的最高点；3) 改质量，确认 x-y 轨迹几乎不变而能量条变化。页面只显示模型 sample() 返回的 states/events，不在界面内另算物理公式。</p></section></main><script>(function(){'use strict';var $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id)};var base=(globalThis.__HARNESS_INPUT__&&globalThis.__HARNESS_INPUT__.scenario)||{mode:'horizontal',speed_m_s:4,angle_deg:0,x0_m:0,y0_m:5,g_m_s2:1.62,mass_kg:0.2};var states=[],events={},S=50,DT=0.05,tl=null;function num(id){return parseFloat($(id).value)}function scenario(){var md=$('mode').value;var an=md==='horizontal'?0:num('ang');return{mode:md,speed_m_s:num('speed'),angle_deg:an,x0_m:0,y0_m:num('h'),g_m_s2:num('g'),mass_kg:num('m')}}function times(){var a=[];for(var i=0;i<=240;i++){a.push(i*DT)}return a}function fit(){var mx=1,my=1,i;for(i=0;i<states.length;i++){if(states[i].x_m>mx){mx=states[i].x_m}if(states[i].y_m>my){my=states[i].y_m}}S=Math.min(560/mx,250/my,70);if(!isFinite(S)||S<=0){S=50}}function px(x){return 40+x*S}function py(y){return 330-y*S}function fmt(x,d){if(x===undefined||x===null||!isFinite(x)){return'--'}return Number(x).toFixed(d===undefined?2:d)}function draw(){fit();var p='',i,s;for(i=0;i<states.length;i++){s=states[i];p+=(i?'L':'M')+px(s.x_m).toFixed(1)+' '+py(s.y_m).toFixed(1)+' '} $('traj').setAttribute('d',p);if(states[0]){$('start').setAttribute('cx',px(states[0].x_m));$('start').setAttribute('cy',py(states[0].y_m))}var land=states[states.length-1];if(events&&isFinite(events.range_m)){land={x_m:events.range_m,y_m:0}}$('land').setAttribute('cx',px(land.x_m));$('land').setAttribute('cy',py(0));$('evf').textContent=fmt(events.flight_time_s,2)+' s';$('evr').textContent=fmt(events.range_m,2)+' m';$('evh').textContent=fmt(events.max_height_m,2)+' m @ '+fmt(events.apex_time_s,2)+' s'}function resample(){var out=coursewareModel.sample({scenario:scenario(),times_s:times()});states=out.states||[];events=out.events||{};draw();if(tl){tl.seek(0)}}function line(el,x,y,vx2,vy2,k){var m=Math.sqrt(vx2*vx2+vy2*vy2)||1;var x2=x+vx2/m*k,y2=y-vy2/m*k;el.setAttribute('x1',x);el.setAttribute('y1',y);el.setAttribute('x2',x2);el.setAttribute('y2',y2)}function show(st){$('pt').textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatPhysicalTime(st.physicalTimeS);$('dr').textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatDemoRate(st.demoRate);if(!states.length){return}var idx=Math.round(st.physicalTimeS/DT);if(idx<0){idx=0}if(idx>states.length-1){idx=states.length-1}var s=states[idx],X=px(s.x_m),Y=py(s.y_m);$('ball').setAttribute('cx',X);$('ball').setAttribute('cy',Y);line($('vx'),X,Y,s.vx_m_s,s.vy_m_s,46);line($('ax'),X,Y,s.ax_m_s2,s.ay_m_s2,54);var me=Math.max(1e-9,Math.abs(s.mechanical_j));$('ek').textContent=fmt(s.kinetic_j,2)+' J';$('ep').textContent=fmt(s.potential_j,2)+' J';$('ekb').style.width=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,100*s.kinetic_j/me))+'%';$('epb').style.width=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,100*s.potential_j/me))+'%';var landed=events.flight_time_s&&st.physicalTimeS>events.flight_time_s+0.02;$('cap').textContent=landed?'已落地：y 固定为 0，可回放或改参数':'t='+fmt(s.t_s,2)+'s  逐点采样，绿色虚线为轨迹';$('ro').textContent='x='+fmt(s.x_m)+' m, y='+fmt(s.y_m)+' m, vx='+fmt(s.vx_m_s)+' m/s, vy='+fmt(s.vy_m_s)+' m/s, a=('+fmt(s.ax_m_s2)+','+fmt(s.ay_m_s2)+') m/s², E='+fmt(s.mechanical_j)+' J'}tl=CoursewarePrimitives.createTimeline({durationPhysicalS:12,onChange:show});['mode','speed','ang','h','g','m'].forEach(function(id){$(id).addEventListener('input',function(){$('spv').textContent=fmt(num('speed'),1);$('anv').textContent=fmt(num('ang'),0);$('hv').textContent=fmt(num('h'),1);$('gv').textContent=fmt(num('g'),2);$('mv').textContent=fmt(num('m'),2);if(id==='mode'&&$('mode').value==='horizontal'){$('ang').value=0;$('anv').textContent='0'}resample()})});$('play').addEventListener('click',function(){tl.play()});$('pause').addEventListener('click',function(){tl.pause()});$('replay').addEventListener('click',function(){tl.replay()});$('rate').addEventListener('input',function(){tl.setDemoRate(parseFloat($('rate').value))});document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',function(){if(document.hidden){tl.pause()}});resample();show({physicalTimeS:0,demoRate:1,playing:false})})();</script></body></html>\"}",
